<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICAN AUG GOLD/FOREX RESERVES 10.08 BLN RAND.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICAN AUG GOLD/FOREX RESERVES 10.08 BLN RAND.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's combined gold and</p>
<p>foreign exchange reserves fell 292.06 million rand in August to</p>
<p>10.078 billion rand from July's 10.37 billion rand, when they</p>
<p>fell 883.3 million rand, Reserve Bank figures show.</p>
<p>Economists polled by Reuters had forecast August reserves at</p>
<p>10.1 billion rand, with the range 9.6 to 10.5 billion rand.</p>
<p>  Details(rounded)    Aug '96	   Jul  '96    Aug  '95</p>
<p>Assets: (Rand millions)</p>
<p>  Gold		    6264.30	    6531.27     5861.97 </p>
<p>  Foreign		 3813.92	    3839.01     6042.75</p>
<p>  Total		  10078.22	   10370.28    11904.72</p>
<p>  Gold shr of total     62.2  pct	  62.9	  49.2</p>
<p>  Gold volume		3.99 mln oz	4.21	  4.66</p>
<p>  Gold value	    1567.26 rand/oz  1550.59     1259.28</p>
<p>  Other liabilities	5.49 bln rand    5.51	  6.22</p>
<p>  Total liabilities     31.42 bln rand   31.55	 32.26</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)</p>
</text>
